.TH HACKWISH 6.SH NAMEhackwish \- play hack until a wand of wishing turns up.SH SYNOPSIS\fBhackwish\fRobject.SH DESCRIPTIONIn hack a wizard sometimes starts with a wand of wishing.\fBhackwish\fRstarts hack again and again, zapping every wand the new wizard carries,until one of them is a wand of wishing; then it wishes for\fIobject\fRand saves the game, so that the next\fBhack\fRcarries on with the wish granted.  It reports each attempt as\fBGame 1\fR,\fR\fBGame 2\fR,\fRand at the end which game it found the wand in..PPWhatever is given is taken as the wish, so\fBhackwish \-?\fRwishes for `\-?'..SH FILESIt runs\fB/dd/CMDS/GAMES/hack\fR,\fRand plays in hack's own playground..SH SEE ALSOhack